{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794868552005,"sessionID":"ses_e1984dae4ffewGkE5pBa89LndO","part":{"partID":"prt_1e680974f002UiFVoB48471zWE","sessionID":"ses_e1984dae4ffewGkE5pBa89LndO","messageID":"msg_1e6808a27001hArUNIBBpfl0qI","type":"tool","id":"call_36ca885382614a08bdcc0ad4","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && git show e626653ce79:specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/040-final-alignment-loop/decision-record.md | grep -n \"ADR-001\\|AC-004\""},"output":"37:| ADR-001 | Waive AC-004 for probes P05, P08 and P09, and keep their routes. | P05, \"check whether the skill graph is stale and show me how to rebuild it\", asks how to rebuild the graph, and `/doctor:helper` ranks `/doctor:skill-advisor rebuild` first for it (`doctor-helper-match.cjs --top=3`), the repair the reader asked for. P08 and P09 name this packet's own behaviour arena and routing arm. Routing them to the advisor needed the words arena, clean, arm and briefs in its intent signals, and review pass thirteen showed those words then pulled ordinary prompts such as \"the routing arm of the load balancer is flaky\" to the advisor. Taken under D1 as the recommended option. P07 is fixed with \"vibe prompt hook\" alone. | None | AC-004, T006, `scratch/probes.json`, `scratch/after-pass-13.txt` |\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"37:| ADR-001 | Waive AC-004 for probes P05, P08 and P09, and keep their routes. | P05, \"check whether the skill graph is stale and show me how to rebuild it\", asks how to rebuild the graph, and `/doctor:helper` ranks `/doctor:skill-advisor rebuild` first for it (`doctor-helper-match.cjs --top=3`), the repair the reader asked for. P08 and P09 name this packet's own behaviour arena and routing arm. Routing them to the advisor needed the words arena, clean, arm and briefs in its intent signals, and review pass thirteen showed those words then pulled ordinary prompts such as \"the routing arm of the load balancer is flaky\" to the advisor. Taken under D1 as the recommended option. P07 is fixed with \"vibe prompt hook\" alone. | None | AC-004, T006, `scratch/probes.json`, `scratch/after-pass-13.txt` |\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && git show e626653ce79:specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/040-final-alignment-loop/decision-record.md | grep -n \\\"ADR-001\\\\|AC-004\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1794868549455,"end":1794868552005}}}}
