{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794869603642,"sessionID":"ses_e1984dae4ffewGkE5pBa89LndO","part":{"partID":"prt_1e690a28b001W0zWKUs6xB8J6v","sessionID":"ses_e1984dae4ffewGkE5pBa89LndO","messageID":"msg_1e6909792001GuGc3HvnFgzTpO","type":"tool","id":"call_d8b7bf4c7c2c48738aa8dbb8","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Init: none.\n- Iteration 1: none. The first attempt at `doctor-helper-match.cjs` put the prompt before `--` and was rejected; the documented `--` form worked.\n- Iteration 3: recording `checklist_evidence` as `partial` left a hard gating failure in the registry, so the stop was blocked. The protocol is a run-level judgement; re-recording a partial status on a replay pass re-opens it.\n- Iteration 4: closing the protocol raised the score to 1, but two zero-novelty passes had already tripped the stuck threshold, so the decision was `STUCK_RECOVERY` rather than `STOP`. The recovery event and a changed-granularity pass were needed before the stop.\n- Iteration 5: none. The per-signal sweep confirmed the F001 boundary and found no new out-of-contract case.","oldString":"- Init: none.\n- Iteration 1: none. The first attempt at `doctor-helper-match.cjs` put the prompt before `--` and was rejected; the documented `--` form worked.","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/data-14/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/data-14/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/data-14/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/data-14/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/ro