RY` rather than `STOP`. The recovery event and a changed-granularity pass were needed before the stop.\\n- Iteration 5: none. The per-signal sweep confirmed the F001 boundary and found no new out-of-contract case.\",\"oldString\":\"- Init: none.\\n- Iteration 1: none. The first attempt at `doctor-helper-match.cjs` put the prompt before `--` and was rejected; the documented `--` form worked.\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/data-14/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794869600907,"end":1794869603642}}}}
